# Root lab (D12, D42, D67, D68). Switch the map to the Root view. Thorn's Burrowing Moles and
# a Root Cellar hide below; Pyra sees a Root occupant only from her own Root presence on the
# same or a neighbouring hex. Try: Descend blind onto a hidden mole (the action fails, AP spent),
# Ascend, Night Shade sneaking under Pyra's lines, Raise the Fallen on a Remnant.
name Root lab
seed 3
map hexagon 3
start A 0,3
start B 0,-3
home A radius=0
home B radius=0
neutral fill terrain.earth
champion A champion.pyra
champion B champion.thorn
terraindeck A terrain.fire
terraindeck B terrain.darkness
openinghand 0
noshuffle
bond B -1,-2 -1,-1
place A creature.burrower 0,1
place A creature.fire-warrior 0,2
place B creature.burrower 0,0 slice=Root
place B creature.burrower 1,-1 slice=Root
place B creature.night-shade -1,1 slice=Root
place B structure.root-cellar -1,-1
handcard B spell.raise
mana B Darkness 3
